1
00:00:03,637 --> 00:00:07,177
I (INDIANA JONES THEME PLAYS) I

2
00:00:10,811 --> 00:00:13,091
-So what did you think?
-It was good.

3
00:00:13,814 --> 00:00:16,154
That's it? "Good"?

4
00:00:16,316 --> 00:00:17,916
(Amy:)I enjoyed it.

5
00:00:18,085 --> 00:00:20,255
(Amy:)When you told me I was going to be
"losing my virginity,"

6
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,560
(Amy:)I didn't think you meant showing me
Raiders of the Lost Ark

7
00:00:22,723 --> 00:00:23,763
(Amy:)for the first time.

8
00:00:24,758 --> 00:00:27,708
(Sheldon:)My apologies.
I chose my words poorly.

9
00:00:27,861 --> 00:00:29,101
(Sheldon:)I should have said

10
00:00:29,263 --> 00:00:31,673
(Sheldon:)you were about to have
your world rocked on my couch.

11
00:00:34,735 --> 00:00:36,375
(Sheldon:)Anyway, thank you for watching it.

12
00:00:36,537 --> 00:00:38,277
It's one of my all-time favorites.

13
00:00:38,438 --> 00:00:40,508
(Amy:)It was very entertaining,

14
00:00:40,674 --> 00:00:42,954
(Amy:)despite the glaring story problem.

15
00:00:44,177 --> 00:00:46,017
(Sheldon:)Story problem?

16
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:46,889
(Sheldon:)Oh.

17
00:00:47,114 --> 00:00:48,284
(Sheldon:)Amy...

18
00:00:50,417 --> 00:00:53,227
(Sheldon:)What a dewy-eyed moon-calf you are.

19
00:00:53,387 --> 00:00:56,027
(Sheldon:)Raiders of the Lost Ark is
the love child

20
00:00:56,189 --> 00:00:58,139
(Sheldon:)of Steven Spielberg and George Lucas,

21
00:00:58,292 --> 00:01:00,772
(Sheldon:)two of the most gifted filmmakers
of our generation.

22
00:01:00,928 --> 00:01:03,428
(Sheldon:)I've watched it 36 times,

